# The Ogham stones of the Wikidata WikiProject OghamStones (Q126491026): every item that is "part of" (P361) the WikiProject.
# The WikiProject page models a stone as instance of ogham stone (Q2016147), archaeological artefact (Q220659) and Ogham Stone
# Semantic Concept (Q106602643), and as part of the WikiProject and of that concept. The first run (2026-11-18) found 8 items: the 7 stones
# of the examples on that page and the item of the WikiProject Irish Ogham Stones (Q106922896), which is part of the WikiProject too but is no
# stone. The filter below leaves out items that are a WikiProject (Q16695773).
# The verb seeds-from-sparql runs this query at query.wikidata.org; ?kind becomes the column "kind" of the seed list.
# The sites (Q69378412 ...), the concepts of Macalister (CIIC) and the counties that the stones point to come in as stubs
# (label and description only); they are not seeds. More stones that this query does not reach go into wikidata-qids.txt.
SELECT DISTINCT ?item ?itemLabel ?kind WHERE {
  ?item wdt:P361 wd:Q126491026 .
  FILTER NOT EXISTS { ?item wdt:P31 wd:Q16695773 }
  BIND("stone" AS ?kind)
  SERVICE wikibase:label { bd:serviceParam wikibase:language "en,de,mul". }
}
ORDER BY ?item
